OL,3,GNEWSASchool closes at short notice
OL,4,Aafter gas supply issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school in Nottinghamshire has
OL,7,Fannounced a short-notice closure after
OL,8,Fit was left without a gas supply.
OL,10,FQuarrydale Academy, in
OL,11,FSutton-in-Ashfield, announced in a post
OL,12,Fon social media on Friday morning that
OL,13,Fthe school would be closed for the day
OL,14,Fdue to an "expected issue with a faulty
OL,15,Fgas valve".
OL,17,FThe issue meant the kitchen was left
OL,18,Fwithout a gas supply, leaving the
OL,19,Fschool's canteen "fully
OL,20,Fun-operational", which led to the
OL,21,Fdecision to close.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
